cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MEP Extraction (EEGLAB Pipeline)"

message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository."

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Bevacqua
    given-names: Naomi
    email: naomi.bevacqua@ugent.be
    affiliation: Ghent University

repository-code: "https://github.com/bevacquanaomi/MEP-extraction-eeglab-brainvision"
url: "https://github.com/bevacquanaomi/MEP-extraction-eeglab-brainvision"

abstract: >
  MATLAB script for extraction of Motor Evoked Potentials (MEPs) from EMG/EEG data
  recorded using a BrainVision system and processed in EEGLAB. The pipeline computes
  MEP peak-to-peak amplitudes, pre-stimulus EMG activity, and latency proxies, and
  includes manual trial quality control.

keywords:
  - EEG
  - EMG
  - MEP
  - TMS
  - EEGLAB
  - BrainVision
  - MATLAB
  - neurophysiology

